  partName: Intake Manifold Gasket
  description: The Intake Manifold Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned
    at the top-center-front of the engine, made of Material.005, which provides excellent
    sealing properties. Its primary function is to prevent air and fuel leaks from
    the intake manifold, ensuring the engine runs efficiently and effectively. Notably,
    the gasket's material composition allows it to withstand the high pressures and
    temperatures generated by the engine's intake system.
